 <iati-activity default-currency="USD" hierarchy="1" iati-activities:version="2.02" linked-data-uri="https://www.iadb.org/en/project/CO-L1003" xml:lang="EN" xmlns:iati-activities="http://d-portal.org/xmlns/iati-activities" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
  <iati-identifier>XI-IATI-IADB-CO-L1003</iati-identifier>
  <reporting-org ref="XI-IATI-IADB" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inter-American Development Bank</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Rural Housing Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Nacional de Vivienda Rural</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo principal de la operacin ser apoyar al gobierno nacional en el perfeccionamiento y ajuste de los instrumentos y procedimientos utilizados en el progama existente para la provisin de subsidios para la vivienda rural, as como el mejoramiento de la gestin, seguimiento y evaluacin del programa y de la poltica nacional de vivienda rural.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Program will finance activities related to demand subsidies for social housing including house improvement and construction. Moreover, and with the purpose of improving the assignment of subsidies, the program will finance activities that will allow better technical and financial execution procedures and information systems. The program will implement a monitoring and evaluation system to improve the availability of information on social housing (housing quality; execution timelines, assignment cost, level of progress and impact of the institutional strengthening tasks), in order to enhance the implementation of policies in the sector. The Urban Housing Program (1483OC-CO) will complement the activities described.</narrative>
  </description>
